Welcome, ronin — this is Samurai OS. Arch in spirit, sharpened for you.

Install:
  graphical     the desktop icon "Install Samurai OS (graphical)" (Ctrl+Alt+F1)
  terminal      samurai-install

Your blade is the `samurai` command:
  samurai update       refresh the system — a snapshot is taken first, always
  samurai snap         capture this moment before you act
  samurai rescue       for when the path darkens
  samurai health       check the blade for nicks, and mend them

Ethernet walks in on its own. Wi-Fi: the network icon, or nmtui.
